====================================================
KEY TAKEAWAYS
====================================================

Day 15 was focused on strategy and clarity.

Major realizations:
- basics are not enough
- strong fundamentals are mandatory
- consistency matters more than random effort
- software engineering offers the strongest opportunity path
- applied AI can be a differentiator

Today was not about building.

It was about understanding exactly what needs to be built.